          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mafundisho gha weke wawa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao Mafarisayo na walimu wa Sharia wamu wifumie Jerusalemu, wikakwanyika imbiri ya Jesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wikawiwona wanughi wake wamu wikija vindo na vala viseoghoshero seji ifwane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Angu Mafarisayo na Wayahudi wose, ngera wiseoghie vala putu, ndewijagha anduangi, wikighuwadia mzango ghwa waghosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sena, wikafuma sokonyi, ngera wisekuoghoshere, ndewijagha kindo chingi anduangi. Sena eko mizango mizima milazi winekelo kuiwadia, sa kuoghosha vikombe, sufuria, na vilambo va shaba.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao Mafarisayo na walimu wa Sharia wikamkotia Jesu, “Welee, kwaki wanughi wako wiseghutalagha mzango ghwa waghosi, ela wadaja vindo wiseoghoshere vala seji ifwane?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu ukawizera, “Isaya orelodieghe nicha aighu konyu inyo waji-kuwi, sa iji koni oreandikieghe:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwaghusigha momu ghwa Mlungu na kughuwadia mzango ghwa wadamu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu ukachuria kuwizera, “Loli moko na wuya ghonyu gholegha sharia ya Mlungu, eri mughuwadie mzango ghwa mzenyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu Musa oreghorieghe, ‘Kuwibonyere ishima ndeyo na mayo,’ na, ‘Uo ose ughoragha kiwiwi kwa ndee angu kwa mae, ndefo kifwa.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.20.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuf. 20.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.21.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "21.17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.20.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wal. 20.9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.5.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wuk. 5.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela inyo mwaghamba, ngera mundu wamzera ndee angu mae, ‘Icho kwaghambagha nikuneke ni Korban’ (kutambua kwaro, chanekwa Mlungu), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nao huwo kedi ndekosere kwa kumwima ndee angu mae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Huwo mwaghunona momu ghwa Mlungu kwa kughuwadia mzango ghwa mzenyu. Sena na vilambo vingi sa ivi mwavibonya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Maza ridimagha kumlusha mundu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu ukajiwanga izungu ja wandu wimchee sena, ukawizera, “Nisikirienyi inyo mmbose, sena mtambukilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndekuwadie kindo chingi shighadi ya mundu chikamngia andenyi kwake chidimagha kumghalusa kulua anduangi. Ela ivo vifumagha andenyi kwake nivo veni vimghalusagha kulua. [ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mndungi ukakaia na madu ghesikira, ndesikire.”]",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata iji wameria kujisigha izungu na kungia nyumbenyi, wanughi wake wikamkotia kutambua kwaro ghuja mfwano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao ukawizera, “Welee, hata na inyo wori ndemtambukilwagha? Ndemtambuagha angu icho chose chiko shighadi, chikangia andenyi kwa mundu, ndechidimagha kumlusha anduangi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "angu ndechingiagha ngolonyi anduangi, ela kifunyi kwake, sena chiaida noko choronyi?” Kwa kughora huwo, Jesu ukaelesha vindo vose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao ukaghamba, “Icho chimfumagha mundu, nicho cheni chimlushagha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu kufuma kondenyi kwa ngolo ra wandu, ghadafuma maririkanyo ghizamie, kulaka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wutoi, kubwagha, kusela na waka wa wandu, iriso, wuwiwi, wukalo, wusawi, kurasha, wung'eti na wukelu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iri maza rizamie rose radafuma andenyi, naro radamlusha mundu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Irumirio ja muka umu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu ukawuka aho, ukaghenda masanga gha Tiro na Sidoni. Ukangia nyumba imu ukikunda mndungi usemanye, ela ndeeredimikieghe uvisike anduangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao ahoeni, muka umu mnjighe wake uko na pepo izamie, ukasikira wuvoro ghwake, ukacha ukaghwa maghunyi kwake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao orekoghe muka wa Kigriki, mbari ya Wasurofoinike. Ukamlomba Jesu uiwinge pepo ifume kwa mnjighe wake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu ukamzera, “Leka wana wighude kande, angu si nicha kuviwusa vindo va wana na kuvikumbia koshi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela uja muka ukamzera, “Ni loli Bwana, ela hata koshi riko mezenyi na kosi, rajagha misusure ipotokagha kufuma kwa wana.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu ukamzera, “Kwa ilagho iji, kwende chia yako. Pepo yamfuma mwana wako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho uja muka ukaghenda nyumbenyi kwake, ukamkua mnjighe wake walala wulinyi, na pepo yameria kumfuma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jesu kuboisa mundu kituri usededagha",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu ukafuma isanga ja Tiro, ukaidia Sidoni, hata ndiwa ya Galilaya, ukiida aghadi ya isanga ja Dekapoli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wikamredia mundu ufue madu, sena ughughumiagha, wikimvoya ummbikirie mikonu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu ukamfunya uja mundu nambai ya jija izungu, ukamngira vala va madu, ukachuya mada na kumuadada lumi lwake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukazighana aighu mlungunyi na kusoria ngolo, ukamzera, “Efatha,” kutambua kwaro, “Tambuka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao madu ghake ghikatambuka, na lumi lwake lukafunguka, ukadeda nicha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao ukawilaghira wisakemghoria mndungi. Ela uduawilaghira huwo saki, niko wichurie kughieresha malagho agho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu wikashinika nandighi loli-loli, wikighamba, “Wadabonya maza rose nicha: wadabonya hata wifue madu wisikire, na vituri widede.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
